{"id": "EUVD-2026-103950", "enisaUuid": "f72468bb-f0fd-37e7-a30a-c5c795bca8b6", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nUSB: serial: fix driver deregistration order\n\nUSB serial driver modules register one driver for the USB bus and one or\nmore drivers for the ports on the USB serial bus.\n\nWhen unloading a driver module, the USB driver must be deregistered\nbefore the USB serial bus drivers so that I/O is stopped before\nunbinding the ports to avoid use-after-free in completion handlers\naccessing port data.\n\nNote that the \"new_id\" attributes must first be removed to prevent new\nids from being added and triggering a probe of the USB driver after it\nhas been deregistered.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T15:46:20", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:55:45", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e7ad832b1144df19cbbaaa655625c6f984e85b9f", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9b085a06a0a411b0bcdf18b61c3ebf1be1c72ffe", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a1aa474768f69ea3a70da523f00f74c264cfa10e", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/428d479a0d31460fbf5969ab262ccd673f1fac01", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/646e5b28b4fdbc1b828a2398d6ced2c1dd308a46"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98696", "GHSA-7jf2-f6fj-7mgx"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2c06b060-feef-3597-8337-c4d7efee4e8f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "765e0ba62613fb90f09c1b5926750df0aa56f349 <a1aa474768f69ea3a70da523f00f74c264cfa10e"}, {"id": "335a0c24-7c3d-3ac6-a980-04e20b59b4f8", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "4cea4fe9-465b-34f3-b733-6c85df2b4a3a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "765e0ba62613fb90f09c1b5926750df0aa56f349 <9b085a06a0a411b0bcdf18b61c3ebf1be1c72ffe"}, {"id": "5450be7d-7b44-3684-a63a-45268ec0149e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "765e0ba62613fb90f09c1b5926750df0aa56f349 <646e5b28b4fdbc1b828a2398d6ced2c1dd308a46"}, {"id": "5df1b381-1c50-39fb-a756-f77666900fe5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "765e0ba62613fb90f09c1b5926750df0aa56f349 <428d479a0d31460fbf5969ab262ccd673f1fac01"}, {"id": "64873760-2214-3e28-9e55-af7a00b92701", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "71a6e2d8-e36e-3fdc-8a8d-d482499e72fc", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.113"}, {"id": "96d00fd2-80b0-300b-875f-51c22b7bd14d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "3.4"}, {"id": "ac5bdeb9-f0d1-337d-9fbb-2d96b0514e91", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.10"}, {"id": "b0fe897b-e4f4-35a6-98f2-e3518e470142", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.160"}, {"id": "e0648e53-736e-3ce4-833d-51cbc6f639a4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.56"}, {"id": "f94e9c73-cc60-3425-83a4-735cd0c04f97", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "765e0ba62613fb90f09c1b5926750df0aa56f349 <e7ad832b1144df19cbbaaa655625c6f984e85b9f"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ba06530a-0c35-30c0-a7b2-42cdc56ea9a4", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}